# This repo feeds TWO Vercel projects: "nemesis-web" (root dir apps/web) and
# "nemesis" (root dir landing — the www.enternemesis.com landing site). This
# file applies to BOTH, so it must never exclude either project's root dir.
# Excluding `landing` here (2026-07-20) broke every landing deploy with
# "No Next.js version detected". Keep local build artifacts and unrelated
# desktop/marketing work out of the deployment bundle.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo

apps/desktop-agent
apps/nemesis-desktop
marketing
tmp

.claude
.gstack
.obsidian
docs
supabase

/*.canvas
/*.jpeg
/*.jpg
/*.png
/*.webp
/*.mp4
